person","person_id":"cbr-p002720","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m008-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002721","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m008-0046","start":46,"end":50,"surface":"范、中行","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、卜辭或未定指代，未補成員姓名與親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m008-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"田乞","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002720","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p009","text":"景公太子死，後有寵姬曰芮子，生子荼。景公病，命其相國惠子與髙昭子以子荼爲太子。景公卒，兩相髙、國立荼，是爲晏孺子。而田乞不説，欲立景公他子陽生。陽生素與乞歡。晏孺子之立也，陽生奔魯。田乞偽事髙昭子、國惠子者，毎朝代參乘，言曰：「始諸大夫不欲立孺子。孺子旣立，君相之，大夫皆自危，謀作亂。」又紿大夫曰：「髙昭子可畏也，及未發先之。」諸大夫從之。田乞、鮑牧與大夫以兵入公室，攻髙昭子。昭子聞之，與國惠子救公。公師敗。田乞之衆追國惠子，惠子奔莒，遂返殺髙昭子。晏（孺子）［圉］奔魯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002721","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"芮子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002741","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"子荼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002722","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002721","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"國惠子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002723","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"髙昭子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002724",